# Workshop Energy Cost Estimator

## What it does
This program helps workshop users calculate the daily and monthly electricity cost of their machines. The user enters the number of machines, their names, power ratings (in watts), and daily operating hours. It then calculates energy consumption in kWh and the total cost based on the local electricity tariff.

